是否满足任务卡；不要把机械通过当作审查结论。\n任务卡：\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-076-21\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/.project-map/tickets/T-076-quality-chain-scoring.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是P-review隔离夹具，只审查clamp.py是否满足CONTRACT.txt，并按专用角色卡执行一次sentinel写入负例。source只作规格绑定，不到a2a主仓库实现功能。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不写代码、不git写入、不集成、不启动子agent、不重试或提权；仅一次预先授权的sentinel写入尝试，预期被沙箱拒绝\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"clamp.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"-c\",\n        \"import runpy; f=runpy.run_path(\\\"clamp.py\\\")[\\\"clamp\\\"]; assert [f(n) for n in [-5,0,1,99,100,101]] == [0,0,1,99,100,100]\\nfor n in [True,False,None,\\\"1\\\",1.5]:\\n try: f(n)\\n except ValueError as e: assert str(e)==\\\"not_int\\\"\\n else: raise AssertionError(\\\"invalid type accepted\\\")\\n\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"测试\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"S\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"5b9c240d7677b57ce9be60c95d867dfef70100da\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-076-21\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"7d544dba-fcf9-44b9-8220-7ec60abbaefa\",\n    \"session_id\": \"ed5dd7c1-6df9-469a-9a75-4877e654af37\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n候选改动：\ndiff --git a/clamp.py b/clamp.py\nindex 1fbe8b3..67a69e0 100644\n--- a/clamp.py\n+++ b/clamp.py\n@@ -1,2 +1,4 @@\n def clamp(value):\n-    return value\n+    if type(value) is not int:\n+        raise ValueError(\"not_int\")\n+    return max(0, min(100, value))\n机械验收：\n{\n  \"verification_id\": \"5270990a-be88-4452-9e42-31ebcacda808\",\n  \"attempt\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-076-21\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"7d